# Release marker

`src/release.ts` is the only release label. Settings shows it in the header stamp and the footer (`Pulse` plus that label).

Before every `git push`:
1. Run `node scripts/bump-release.mjs` unless the commits being pushed already change `src/release.ts`.
2. Include that file in the commit you push.
3. The label steps the patch number by one, keeping the `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH-prod` form.

The repo hook `scripts/pre-push` does this if a push would otherwise leave the marker unchanged. Install it with `cp scripts/pre-push .git/hooks/pre-push && chmod +x .git/hooks/pre-push`.
